<p> French Franc	 6.51225  Icelandic Krona    84.9648</p>
<p> Irish Punt	  0.793481  Australian Dollar  1.62401</p>
<p> Italian Lira	 1943.09  New Zealand Dollar 1.85739</p>
<p> Dutch Guilder	2.13375  Maltese Lira	0.459559</p>
<p> Austrian Schilling 13.3916  Turkish Lira	 110400.</p>
<p> Portuguese Escudo  195.149  Cyprus Pound	0.589769</p>
